a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏀 </span><a href=\"https://throwbacks.substack.com/p/when-did-sports-owners-stop-buying?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=31587&amp;post_id=211049093&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>When Did Sports Owners Stop Buying Into the Cities They Represent?</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p>🏀<strong> <a href=\"https://maxmoacanin.substack.com/p/the-76ers-are-probably-overrated?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2527809&amp;post_id=210166369&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>The 76ers Are Probably Overrated</span></a></strong> by  and <strong><a href=\"https://abovethebreak.substack.com/p/can-the-sixers-microwave-a-champion?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=44478&amp;post_id=211077679&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Can the Sixers Microwave a Champion?</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏀 </span><a href=\"https://www.truehoop.com/p/a-sneaky-way-to-build-around-giannis?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5973&amp;post_id=210890013&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>A sneaky way to build around Giannis</span></a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://kofie.substack.com/p/investigating-the-drunk-lou-williams?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=83234&amp;post_id=210586382&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener no